    "text": "ncktoday.com\nwebsite\nAbilene\nConcordia Volleyball Struggles at Abilene\n1 days ago\nWith the final week of the regular season officially upon the Concordia High School volleyball team, the Panthers are looking to stack some wins and build some momentum going into sub-state. Unfortunately for CHS, the Abilene Cowgirls are trying to do the same thing and won two matches vs the Panthers on Tuesday, October 7th, in Abilene. The Cowgirls won the first match 2-0 and the second match 2-1.",
